        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\n\n&#39; Define Architectural Tier Containers\nframe \&quot;1. INGESTION LAYER\&quot; as L1 {\n  file \&quot;CSV File\&quot; as CSV\n  component \&quot;Ingestion Script\&quot; as SCRIPT\n  CSV -&gt; SCRIPT\n}\n\nframe \&quot;2. PRESENTATION LAYER\&quot; as L2 {\n  card \&quot;Dashboards &amp; Forms\&quot; as UI\n}\n\nframe \&quot;3. SERVICE LAYER\&quot; as L3 {\n  component \&quot;Business Logic &amp; Rules\&quot; as SVC\n}\n\nframe \&quot;4. DATA ACCESS LAYER\&quot; as L4 {\n  component \&quot;Repositories &amp; DTOs\&quot; as REPO\n  interface \&quot;Connection Singleton\&quot; as CONN\n  REPO -&gt; CONN\n}\n\nframe \&quot;5. DATABASE ENGINE\&quot; as L5 {\n  database \&quot;Staging Area\&quot; as STG\n  database \&quot;3NF Operational Schema\&quot; as OLTP\n  node \&quot;ETL Stored Procedures\&quot; as SP\n  database \&quot;Star Schema Warehouse\&quot; as OLAP\n  \n  STG -&gt; OLTP\n  OLTP -&gt; SP\n  SP -&gt; OLAP\n}\n\n&#39; Clean Cross-Layer Connections\nSCRIPT --&gt; STG\nUI --&gt; SVC\nSVC --&gt; REPO\nCONN &lt;--&gt; STG\nCONN &lt;--&gt; OLTP\nCONN &lt;--&gt; OLAP\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="KBIG4spdSW8Bgv0g3NLD-1">
